      "originalText": "li.taskItem\nflex\nrow\nbeetwen/space/around\ncontent: \n    <div.mainTask>\n        <icono.iconoTitleTask>\n        <h2>Titulo tarea</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div.detailsTask>\n            <icono.iconoDetails> (opcional)\n           <button>Detalles</detalles>\n    </div>\n\n    <div.controlsRootTask>\n        <button>Pausar tarea</button>\n        <button>Modificar tarea</button>\n        <button>Eliminar tarea</button>           \n    </div>\n    \n",
